@startuml
title Profile Integration Contract
rectangle "Rohail's General ProfileView (Swing JPanel)" as PV {
  rectangle "Username + Account Dropdown" as Account
  rectangle "Friends Slot (JPanel)" as Friends
  rectangle "My Pins Slot (JPanel)" as Pins
}
rectangle "Katelyn: Friends component (JComponent)" as FriendWidget
rectangle "Katelyn: Pins component (JComponent)" as PinsWidget
rectangle "John: Map / Pin use cases" as Map
Friends ..> FriendWidget : setFriendsComponent(...)
Pins ..> PinsWidget : setPinsComponent(...)
PinsWidget ..> Map : coordinates via shared interfaces
note bottom of PV
Account/session classes do not call
Katelyn's use cases or data stores directly.
end note
@enduml
